{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06684","headline":"同张侍御鼎和京兆萧兵曹华岁晚南园 · 储光羲","name":"同张侍御鼎和京兆萧兵曹华岁晚南园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公府传休沐，私庭效陆沈。\n方知从大隐，非复在幽林。\n阙下忠贞志，人间孝友心。\n既将冠盖雅，仍与薜萝深。\n寒变中园柳，春归上苑禽。\n池涵青草色，山带白云阴。\n潘岳闲居赋，锺期流水琴。\n一经当自足，何用遗黄金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06684.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06684","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}